  "title": "NOV Announces 20 Percent Increase in Regular Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, Feb. 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NOV Inc. (NYSE: NOV) announced today that its Board of Directors voted to increase its regular quarterly cash dividend by 20 percent to $0.09 per share of common stock. The quarterly dividend is payable on March 27, 2026 to each stockholder of record on",
